The Z-matrix for the fep calculation needs to be called fepzmat. Then,
to execute an entire fep calculation in a 15-A water cap with T=25C,
just enter
csh fepcmd >& log &

Infinite cutoffs are used here - see JPCA 2, 1499-1509 (2006).

xFEPCAP15 provides a convenient way to run a single fep calculation
in any directory.

